## What is where

| Package | Contents |
|---|---|
| `dto` | one class per payload, with Bean Validation annotations |
| `web` | REST controllers, one per tag |
| `service` | service interfaces and implementations: each endpoint is a method, each rule a private method |
| `route` | Apache Camel routes for endpoints in processing-route style |
| `messaging` | message listeners and the gateway used to publish |
| `persistence` | JPA entities, repositories and stores |
| `client` | REST clients for the services the enrich rules call |
| `mapper` | MapStruct mappers for the transform rules |
| `support` | `Expressions`, which evaluates the rule expressions null-safely |
| `error` | exceptions and the error handler that turns them into HTTP problems |

